04DD                             ; fin: end the input line: CR LF and a NUL after it, and a new line on the
04DD                             ; terminal. Leaves BC -> the line and HL -> the NUL.
04DD   26 0A        FIN:      LD   H,LETPAGE   
04DF   6B                     LD   L,E   
