053C                             ; The command keys, and where each goes (after fin).
053C   0D           CMDS:     DB   13   
053D   8F 05                  DW   cret   
053F   07                     DB   7   ; ^G
0540   D7 05                  DW   crun   
0542   0C                     DB   12   ; ^L
0543   E9 05                  DW   clist   
