0562   C3 96 04     GED0:     JP   edit   
0565                             ; ^E: line n goes into the input line, to be changed. EDLN remembers which
0565                             ; line it was: Return puts the text back in its place.
0565   CD 03 03     CEDLN:    CALL   rdnum   
0568   E5                     PUSH   HL   
