058F                             ; a number and text is a line to put in, a number alone a line to take out,
058F                             ; and anything else is run where it is.
058F   E5           CRET:     PUSH   HL   ; the end of what was typed
0590   2A 3A 0A               LD   HL,(EDLN)   
