05C8   EB                     EX   DE,HL   
05C9   E3                     EX   (SP),HL   ; HL = the length; where it goes is kept
05CA   E5                     PUSH   HL   
05CB   19                     ADD   HL,DE   ; the NUL's new place
05CC   EB                     EX   DE,HL   
